OL,5,G0930 Essential Classics
OL,6,     FGeorgia Mann plays the best in
OL,7,     Fclassical music, with discoveries
OL,8,     Fand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,9,     Fwith familiar favourites.
OL,10,G1300 Classical Live
OL,11,     FFurther highlights from the
OL,12,     FHay-on-Wye festival, plus
OL,13,     Fconcertos for wind instruments,
OL,14,     Ftoday the turn of the oboe, and a
OL,15,     Frare chance to hear Emilie Mayer's
OL,16,     Famazing first symphony.
OL,17,G1600 Composer of the Week: Purcell
OL,18,     F2/5. Donald takes a tour of the
OL,19,     Fchurches of Purcell's London, and
OL,20,     Fexplores the impact on them of the
OL,21,     FEnglish Civil War and the Great
OL,22,     FFire of London.
