OL,7,     FKoumartzis and Lina Palera play
OL,8,     Fthe Ancient Greek Lyre.
OL,9,G1900 Classical Mixtape
OL,10,     FTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,11,     Fsoundscape of classical
OL,12,     Ffavourites, including music by
OL,13,     FByrd, Boulanger and Bernstein.
OL,14,G1930 Radio 3 in Concert
OL,15,     FThe BBC National Orchestra of
OL,16,     FWales perform Rachmaninov's
OL,17,     FSymphonic Dances, a world premiere
OL,18,     Fby Freya Waley-Cohen, and
OL,19,     FElizabeth Ogonek's Sleep and
OL,20,     FUnremembrance.
